<title>USA: Calif. building association elects 1997 president.</title>
<headline>Calif. building association elects 1997 president.</headline>
<dateline>SACRAMENTO, Calif. 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The California Building Industry Association said Monday it elected San Francisco builder Roger Mikulecky as its 1997 president.</p>
<p>Mikulecky, a construction manager and consultant, succeeds Allen Jaffee of San Diego.</p>
<p>The association represents 5,000 builders, subcontractors, architects, designers and other home-building professionals in the state.</p>
